Z||000000||BlackGT||07-28-99||10:33 AM||||This weekend I will be picking up my new toy,<br>a Black 86 GT fastback! I`ve been wanting a Fiero GT for a long time and when I get it I <br>will want to make some upgrades. The first is<br>switching to 17 inch wheels and low profile tires, upgrading and lowering the suspension <br>about 1" in front and 1 1/2" in the rear. The <br>interior I will leave alone for right now but<br>maybe in the future find some real seats that<br>will work in the car. One more mod I will make will be to upgrade the stereo.... there<br>isn`t a lot of room for a sub but reading these posts give me a few idea for that. But<br>as far as the first items are concerned can<br>anyone help me and keep in mind that I`m on a tight budget and the mrs won`t let me spend<br>a lot of money on what she calls a p@#%y mobile! Help me out guys!!
Z||000001||FieroMike||07-28-99||12:06 PM||||Welcome to the wonderful world of Fiero's!! Drop spindles are the way to go on the front and can be purchase from the Fiero Store.  Tires and Wheels you can get anywhere, but I don't know if I would squeeze 17" in there.  A sub definately goes in the front compartment!!  Give us some specific questions in the tech area and I'm sure everyone will be glad to help!
